# Use DESIGN.md

For any UI, layout, styling, or component work in this project:

1. Read and follow root `DESIGN.md` (also mirrored at `.cursor/rules/ntrio-design.mdc`).
2. Presentation only — do not change routes' API shapes, data models, or business logic unless explicitly asked.
3. Use tokens and shared components under `client/src/components/design/` (`Amount`, `ChangeTag`, `PanelCard`, `ListRow`, `StatRow`, `ProgressBar`, `SegmentedControl`).
4. No shadows, gradients, animations, emoji, or decorative colour. Numbers lead; colour only carries credit/debit meaning and is never the only signal.
5. Mobile-first (390px), 44px touch targets, tabular amounts with currency code and +/− sign.
